==Overview ==
The '''Swat Mutant Toilet''' is a new [[Exclusive|Exclusive unit]] added inside of the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]].

==Obtainment==
You can obtain the '''Swat Mutant Toilet''' by buying it for [[File:Robux.png|25px]]399, [[Trading]] for it, or by buying it from the [[Marketplace]], or getting gifted it in the [[Post Office]].

== Appearance ==
The toilet seems to have an army helmet, as well as a police shield, and a sickle for an arm. On the back it appears to some sort of jetpack with four rocket launchers attached to it.

