== Strategy ==

* If you are playing with 2 other friends, you can use this unit as a [[Clock Spider]] but with a higher cooldown and more damage.
* Abysmal mode (with 3 players): Use this unit as early and mid game defense because this unit cannot carry the other 2 players. Use Demented Titan Cameraman or other units with 120k DPS to carry 2 players. (e.g.:[[Toilet Man]], [[Titan Heart Man]], [[Axe Upgraded Titan Speakerman]]).

==Trivia==

*The '''Swat Mutant Toilet''' is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/SWAT_Mutant_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Swat Mutant Toilet] from the series.
*This is the first Movable unit with 100k DPS, considered as the strongest movable unit in the game.
*Cannot be stunned as he blocks all of stuns because of being a Movable.
*Its weaker and cheaper alternative is the [[Sniper Cameraman]].
*For some reason, Telanthric made the 1.0 form of SWAT Mutant Toilet a unit, instead of the 2.0 form with Astro upgrades, such as the double cyber sickles and the Astro visor.

